('CIT_MAN_TIBIL_GINZA','ENT_MAN_TIBIL','SRC_GINZA_RBA','Ginza Rabba (The Great Treasure)','Ginza Rabba (The Great Treasure)','Go to the earth, Arqa ''d Tibil, and make it solid from the murky water. Raise the sky over it. Let fountains of water burst within it. Let it have Yardni, springs, and streams. Prepare the body of Adam. The chosen people will come from Adam. They will ascend to the Place of Light. Call forth with three sounds. With the first sound, the earth will become solid and the sky will stretch forth. The waters will flow and become fresh with the second sound.','Al-Saadi',2019,'None',NULL,'primary-verbatim',NULL,true,'Located by name; verify book/section.',DATE '2026-06-18','name-anchored (note-keyword scored) + substring gate; locus per attestation',1),
('CIT_MAN_TWELVE_GINZA','ENT_MAN_TWELVE','SRC_GINZA_RBA','Ginza Rabba (The Great Treasure)','Ginza Rabba (The Great Treasure)','o being, just like the Children of Peace whom you saw at the House of Life." 131 GR, Book Twelve Hayyi thought of Manda''d Hayyi and said to him, "Send whoever creates this semblance of dignity into the world of darkness, since you are the only one who can do it." Manda ''d Hayyi said, "May you have glory! You called me into being and made me secure. I will come before that world is formed.','Al-Saadi',2019,'None',NULL,'primary-verbatim',NULL,true,'Located by name; verify book/section.',DATE '2026-06-18','name-anchored (note-keyword scored) + substring gate; locus per attestation',1),
('CIT_MAN_WORLD_DARKNESS_GINZA','ENT_MAN_WORLD_DARKNESS','SRC_GINZA_RBA','Ginza Rabba (The Great Treasure)','Ginza Rabba (The Great Treasure)','Darkness is not counted together with light, and the dark abode will not be illuminated. Just as the dark abode will never be illuminated, neither will stagnant waters shimmer. 42 GR, Book Three Is* Glorification Darkness never spreads out, and its denizens take its form. Darkness took shape, and when it took shape, it reviewed its army. Because of the wickedness it has in mind, it is trapped within its own container.','Al-Saadi',2019,'None',NULL,'primary-verbatim',NULL,true,'Located by name; verify book/section.',DATE '2026-06-18','name-anchored (note-keyword scored) + substring gate; locus per attestation',1),
('CIT_MAN_WORLD_LIGHT_GINZA','ENT_MAN_WORLD_LIGHT','SRC_GINZA_RBA','Ginza Rabba (The Great Treasure)','Ginza Rabba (The Great Treasure)','Contents of the Left Volume The return of Shitil, son of Adam to the World of Light 1 The return of Adam to the Place of Light............................. 10 Hawa after the ascension of Adam........................................ 21 I am the Mana, the scion of Hayyi......................................... 27 I am the Mana, the pure and pious........................................','Al-Saadi',2019,'None',NULL,'primary-verbatim',NULL,true,'Located by name; verify book/section.',DATE '2026-06-18','name-anchored (note-keyword scored) + substring gate; locus per attestation',1),
